# AI Execution Logging

Internal production endpoint:

GET /api/admin/ai-logs

Each AI request stores:

- timestamp
- assistant
- AI model
- token usage
- user ID

---

# AI Business Verification

Endpoint:

POST /api/verify-business-registration

The uploaded company registration document is processed by AI to:

- verify business registration
- extract incorporation date
- determine founder eligibility
- automatically apply Founder or Standard pricing

